        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_46b9f0407d6e410e846090a20c89395e",
      "statement": "Bootstrap file permissions are deliberate: parent directories are created with 0700 (os.MkdirAll), the root certificate is written with 0600 via pemutil.Serialize(..., pemutil.ToFile(rootFile, 0o600)), and defaults.json is written with 0644 via fileutil.WriteFile.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://utils/cautils/bootstrap.go#L148-L193",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:833f23fd02d9ffeaed36d801f56b2a8b6be691f3057baa19219ccbe9e6701384:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_148f1eea1a0646ec897202445af59cec",
      "statement": "There is a documentation inconsistency about the defaults.json location: the step ca bootstrap help text says $STEPPATH/configs/defaults.json, while other help text and examples use $STEPPATH/config/defaults.json, and the code itself writes to step.DefaultsFile() whose resolution is owned by cli-utils.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://command/ca/bootstrap.go#L28-L30",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:fb05e8c8e5affdbe2608bb7d5241f0c60d3bada3dca83a7d1875c4f893c908ea:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://command/ca/ca.go#L35-L41",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:1716d33bf8ff5c02c820d356da6daf89a9afebb53cfa8cd32812ece2fd786b19:"
