          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:f953a7e530b07469b4a3895e4256608e25ec90ccbe47b0723349d829293eeb65:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_74eece5eb7bd498190332c220d81d7a1",
      "statement": "After bootstrap, CA commands do not need --ca-url, --root, or --fingerprint for the same environment; some flags are designed to be configured in defaults.json (e.g. the identity flag), and command help documents environment-variable fallbacks such as STEP_CA_URL and STEP_ROOT — the merge mechanism itself is owned by the cli-utils command framework, not this repository.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://command/ca/bootstrap.go#L32-L33",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:347e463f77be2839dbd5df1520c9d4735d3e41c3b6703ccf7984a90187fbe108:"
