      "id": "claim_05a8a04649aa435f8d2cfc2d67aa6c16",
      "statement": "Bootstrap context creation adds a step.Context{Name, Profile, Authority} via step.Contexts(), then SaveCurrent and SetCurrent; unspecified context/profile/authority fall back to the context name, whose flow-specific default is <teamAuthority>.<team> for team bootstraps and the CA URL hostname for plain authority bootstraps.",
