    {
      "id": "claim_4be65ff2b8f14bd2986a86aea3f25e59",
      "statement": "step context remove guards deletions: it requires contexts to be enabled, refuses to remove the current context, removes the authority/profile directories only when no other context shares them (reference-counted across the context list), prompts for confirmation unless --force is given, and finally removes the context's authority line from <base>/ssh/includes.",
