      "id": "claim_2479cc1c09494f6cbe996bd0d86dbfaa",
      "statement": "flags.HiddenNoContext is a hidden BoolTFlag named --no-context that prevents context-specific environment from being applied to a command; it is attached to commands such as step version and the step context subcommands.",
