      "id": "claim_80276a68aa244da1ad0e016201191e6e",
      "statement": "The default root certificate location used by CA commands and client construction is $STEPPATH/certs/root_ca.crt (documented in step ca health help; bootstrap writes there via pki.GetRootCAPath, and NewClient falls back to that path when --root is unset).",
